            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f3" n="3" xml:id="d218-f3-content">
                <p>Secto 465 from Geneva, June 17, reported that the Chinese had requested a meeting
                    on June 19. (396.1 GE/6–1754)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f4" n="4" xml:id="d218-f4-content">
                <p>Dated June 16, not printed. (396.1 GE/6–1654)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
